  "body": "Positioned along Takapuna’s prestigious Golden Mile, this substantial and versatile family residence offers an exceptional opportunity to secure a premium North Shore lifestyle. Elevated to capture sweeping panoramic views across Lake Pupuke, with glimpses of the Hauraki Gulf, this home combines space, sunshine and a sought after location.\r\n\r\nThe north-facing home creates a wonderful sense of light, openness and scale. Thoughtfully configured to accommodate various scenarios, the generous floor plan offers four bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, a dedicated home office and multiple living areas, providing flexibility for families at every stage of life.  Providing the much sought after 'on the flat' walk to bustling Takapuna or Milford village. \r\n\r\nA standout feature is the separate two-bedroom wing, complete with its own lounge area, ideal for children or teenagers seeking independence, extended family, visiting guests or those wanting a more private living arrangement. A parents’ retreat or annex further enhances the home’s versatility, while abundant storage throughout ensures everyday living remains practical and well organised.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the changing outlook from the middle and upper-level balconies, where expansive views across Lake Pupuke provide a beautiful backdrop for morning coffee, relaxed afternoons and evening entertaining. With direct access to the jetty, you can embrace an active outdoor lifestyle and enjoy the best of the Milford and Takapuna communities.\r\n\r\nPracticality is equally well considered, with a two garages with internal access,  a downstairs workshop and generous storage and off street undercover carport and extra parking. The property’s low-maintenance appeal allows more time to enjoy the lifestyle on offer, rather than spending weekends on upkeep.\r\n\r\nFrom leisurely walks along Takapuna Beach to the vibrant local cafés, restaurants and boutiques, everything that makes this coastal community so desirable is within easy level walking distance including popular Milford shops and cafes.  Families will also appreciate access to sought-after schooling, including Takapuna Grammar School and the highly regarded Westlake Boys’ and Westlake Girls’ High Schools.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of scale, flexibility, elevated lake views and a premier Golden Mile position are seldom available, and this property has been held tightly for good reason.\r\n\r\nWith a motivated vendor and a clear timeline, the owners have made the heartfelt decision to sell. Whether you’re accommodating a growing family, planning for multiple generations or simply seeking more space in an exceptional coastal setting, this residence delivers outstanding versatility and lifestyle appeal. Fall in love with the views but stay for the lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSecure your place on Takapuna’s Golden Mile and make the most of everything this remarkable location has to offer.\r\nPhone or text Alison Parker on 021983533 for Malcolm Low on 0274181818 at New Zealand Soheby's International Realty to view today.",
